 "description": "Check whether AI names a website when buyers ask, and whether AI can read it. Starts a live check of one brand-name question and one buyer question on Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT and Claude (results fill in on the report link within about a minute), and returns a 0-100 AI readability score: which AI crawlers the site allows or blocks, whether content is server-rendered, structured-data coverage, and the highest-impact fixes. Use when someone asks whether ChatGPT, Claude or Google AI mention or cite their site, how their site appears to AI, whether AI can read or find it, or asks for an SEO or AI visibility audit of a URL.",
